    "description": "Experience Luxury Living with Breathtaking Iconic San Francisco Views    Step into a world of elegance and sophistication with this exceptional residence, offering iconic San Francisco views of the famous Huntington Park, Grace Cathedral, Fairmont Hotel, Bay Bridge, San Francisco Bay and beyond. Designed with custom high-end finishes and a Parisian flare, the attention to every detail in this home exudes refined luxury. The stunning craftsmanship and exquisitely designed appointments are impressive. All design decisions were ultimately made in service with the home's main star which are the breathtaking views.    Whether you're entertaining in style or savoring quiet moments in a space curated for comfort, this home delivers an unparalleled living experience. As the sun is setting and the beautiful lights start coming on in the City makes for a magical experience all from the privacy of your own home. Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a piece of San Francisco's most treasured skyline."
